{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"fields":{"description":"## Context / immutable audit base\nAt d49fea41cc383dc70d465903e94598a6dc790bd1, these five files contain 36 confirmed bloated prose blocks. The former older-SHA ranges mixed executable code, section labels, directives, and concise/load-bearing docs while missing long read, ancestry, graph, and op-cert explanations. Lines are immutable-base citations only.\n\n## Exact prose allowlist\nA stable ID is the full path plus :: plus the listed suffix. Only these blocks may change.\n\n- src/rebar/_engine_support/reads.py (18): module-docstring@1-22; sort_states-docstring@71-77; tracker_dir-docstring@100-110; tracker_dir::comment(A repo-root was supplied)@141-148; module::comment(Read-path reconverge waits only briefly)@160-164; _sync_disabled-docstring@210-215; ensure_fresh-docstring@225-233; ensure_fresh::comment(sync.pull and tickets.branch are code-repo config)@236-240; ensure_fresh::comment(Claim the throttle window before reconverging)@275-280; ensure_fresh::comment(Reconverge in-process)@286-290; inbound_deps_state-docstring@321-334; show_state::comment(Show emits the same compiled-state shape)@361-364; _load_scratch::comment(scratch.base_dir via typed config)@379-384; module::comment(Fields a discovery list never consumes)@416-425; lean_projection-docstring@437-443; list_states-docstring@448-463; search_state::comment(Enrich each state with its bound Jira key)@580-584; recent_session_logs_state-docstring@608-612.\n- src/rebar/attest/authorship_resolution.py (5): resolve_event_commit-docstring@11-30; resolve_position_commit-docstring@71-82; build_ticket_position_commit_map-docstring@119-154; build_introducing_commit_map-docstring@213-243; build_position_commit_map-docstrin